# Storage, Cache, Offline

## Storage choices
- ✅ Shared prefs: small non-sensitive flags/settings
- ✅ Secure storage: tokens/credentials via `TokenStorage` + `SecureTokenStorage`
  - provider: `lib/shared/providers.dart` (`tokenStorageProvider`)
  - impl: `lib/shared/security/secure_token_storage.dart`
  - in-memory request auth header token: `lib/shared/security/auth_token_provider.dart` (not source of truth)
- ✅ DB (Hive/Isar/SQLite): structured offline data (pick one and standardize)

## Offline strategy
- ✅ Define per feature:
  - cache keying
  - sync strategy
  - conflict handling
  - error states when offline

## Data lifecycle
- ✅ Clear sensitive data on logout
- ✅ Provide migrations strategy for DB schema changes

## NEVER
- ❌ Store secrets in shared prefs
- ❌ Scatter storage calls in widgets
